          model: "Original (roofer follow-up text): “Thank you for contacting Summit Roofing. A representative will reach out within 1–2 business days to schedule your estimate.”\n\nRewrite: “Hi Dave, it's Mike from Summit Roofing. Got your request about the leak over the garage. I'll call you tomorrow before noon to set up a time to come look. If water's coming in right now, text me back and I'll move you up. — Mike”\n\nGenuine detail: naming the actual problem he wrote in about (the garage leak) and a real, specific callback time."
